<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Time 1996 net down 28 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Time 1996 net down 28 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)     6.9	  vs	  12.8</p>
<p>    Net profit	     26.86	 vs	  37.46</p>
<p>    Turnover		704.19	 vs	 756.07</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	 74.71	 vs	  83.47</p>
<p>    Minorities     less   5.01	 vs  add    0.17</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)    7.5	  vs	   7.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of company is Time Engineering Bhd. It provides telecommunications services.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
